						</div>
						<div class="caption">
							<h3>Mantra Meraki</h3>
							<p class="paragraph">Mantra Meraki is a luxury project that offers spacious 2, 3 and 4.5 BHK homes and 3 BHK sky villas with zero space wastage design. The project is spread over three acres of land with 6 towers of 22 storeys each, connected by a central podium with many amenities and a retail boulevard with 18 shops.</p>
