							<img loading="lazy" src="https://www.mantraproperties.in/assets/images/banners/mantra-mirari-713150169.webp" alt="Mantra Mirari" class="img-fluid">
						</div>
						<div class="caption">
							<h3>Mantra Mirari</h3>
							<p class="paragraph">Discover Mantra Mirari, where every experience is luxurious. Enjoy larger-sized homes and multiple amenities that will impress your guests. Live spaciously and luxuriously in 3, 4 &amp; 4.5 BHK homes and 3 BHK sky villas that are well-designed, well-lit and well-ventilated.</p>
							<a href="properties/retail/mantra-mirari">VIEW MORE</a>
