					<div class="upcomingproject__content-block--hover">
						<div class="image">
							<img loading="lazy" src="https://www.mantraproperties.in/assets/images/banners/mantra-mesmer-67817109.webp" alt="Mantra Mesmer" class="img-fluid">
						</div>
						<div class="caption">
							<h3>Mantra Mesmer</h3>
							<p class="paragraph">Mantra Mesmer is a project that focuses on your kids’ holistic growth and happiness. The project has 20+ amenities that foster your kids’ learning, creativity, social skills, and physical fitness. The well-designed 3 BHK homes also include spacious bedrooms for your kids that cater to their future needs. Mantra Mesmer is well-connected to various facilities such as health, education, work and entertainment.</p>
							<a href="properties/retail/mantra-mesmer">VIEW MORE</a>
