						</div>
						<div class="caption">
							<h3>Mantra 29 Gold Coast</h3>
							<p class="paragraph">29 Gold Coast is a luxury project that offers 2 and 3 BHK homes &amp; shops starting from Rs. 71.99 Lakhs* in Dhanori-Tingre Nagar, Pune. The project is located on New Airport Road, close to the International Airport, Panchsheel Tech Park and Phoenix Mall.</p>
