							<p class="paragraph">Mantra Business Centre is a power centre for business tycoons in Upper Koregaon Park, Pune’s most sought after commercial real estate location. The offices here are innovative, efficient, and collaborative spaces with multiple retail, dining and entertainment options.</p>
